---
title: Baked Custard
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 30-40 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{0.25%cup}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@beaten eggs{3}
@hot milk{2%cups}
@vanilla{1%tsp}

Combine sugar, salt and eggs. Add milk slowly, then vanilla. Pour into custard cups and set in a pan of hot water. Bake at 325 degrees for 30-40 minutes or until custard is set.
